<title>JAPAN: Nitto Flour - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nitto Flour - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.95		vs	   12.59</p>
<p> Operating	  444    million	  vs	  300    million</p>
<p> Current	    518    million	  vs	  328    million</p>
<p> Net		  173    million	  vs	  144    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.36 yen	  vs	    3.62 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     40 million	  vs	  40 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nitto Flour Milling Co Ltd is a medium-size flour miller affiliated with Mitsubishi Corp.</p>
</text>
